Given that, \( \tan ^{-1}\left(\frac{x}{y}\right)-\tan ^{-1}\left(\frac{x-y}{x+y}\right) \)<br>\[
\begin{array}{l}
=\tan ^{-1}\left(\frac{x}{y}\right)-\tan ^{-1}\left(\frac{1-\frac{y}{x}}{1+\frac{y}{x}}\right) \\
