\end{array}
\]<br>Since, \( \tan ^{-1} x+\cot ^{-1} x=\frac{I I}{2} \) Then<br>\[
=\frac{I I}{2}-\tan ^{-1} 1=\frac{I}{2}-\frac{I}{4}=\frac{I}{4}
\]

