n_{1} \sin \theta_{1}=n_{4} \sin \theta_{4}
\]<br>But \( \theta_{1}=\theta_{4} \)<br>Therefore, \( n_{1}=n_{4} \)

The velocity of a body rolling without slipping down oninclined plane is given as<br>\[
v=\sqrt{\frac{2 g h}{1+K^{2} / R^{2}}}
