\Rightarrow v_{s}=\sqrt{\frac{10 g h}{7}}
\]<br>For solid cylinder, \( K=\frac{R}{\sqrt{2}} \)<br>\[
\Rightarrow v_{c}=\sqrt{\frac{4 g h}{3}}
\]

Given, collector current variation, \( \Delta I_{\mathrm{c}}=0.49 \mathrm{~mA} \) emittercurrent variation, \( \Delta I_{\mathrm{E}}=0.50 \mathrm{~mA} \)<br>Now, current gain,<br>\[
\begin{array}{l}
